  "starterCode": "import numpy as np\n\ndef batch_generator(X: list, y: list, batch_size: int, seed: int = 42, drop_last: bool = False):\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns a generator of (X_batch, y_batch) tuples.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Write code here\n    pass",
